Builds reVC on librw's WGPU platform (Phase 2 design, section 8): the GLFW skeleton and
input code paths for RW_WGPU, txd.img conversion as with GL3, the colour filter and screen
droplets through the renderer's Im2D override shaders, the custom pipelines of
src/extras/custompipes_wgpu.cpp, and NEW_RENDERER kept off. Applied by reVC Builder.

